            "review_title": "Review at Nep Nha Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ha Phuong L\n6 contributions\n0\nGreat authentic Vietnamese food in a cozy environment\nOct 2017 • Friends\nI must have come here more than 10 times already and they have only been open for 2 months. And they have not disappointed me once. The food is really super tasty. And the staff is really friendly. This is really recommended !!!\n\nThey even have Pho for breakfast only, super cheap price as well\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 13, 2017",
